cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OmniSeek in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "OmniSeek: a self-hosted perception MCP server for AI agents"
abstract: "A self-hosted perception MCP server for AI agents: it transcribes speech nobody wrote down, reads images and video frames, crosses languages, reads login-walled pages with the operator's own credentials, and accumulates everything it reaches into persistent retrieval memory and a source-traced evidence graph. It returns structured evidence with provenance; it never generates, judges, or phones home."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
